  "description": {
   "en": "Sora Mukushima lived a modest but peaceful life with his parents — until everything changed. \n\nOne day, a mysterious tower appeared, his soldier brother went missing, and monstrous creatures began attacking without warning. In the face of death, a strange man from Sora’s dreams appeared, pulling him into another world: a dark, unforgiving realm known as the Abyss.\n\nNow stranded in this hostile dimension, Sora must fight to survive, grow stronger, and find a way back home. Driven by the desire to save his family and uncover the truth behind the Abyss, he steps into a battle that will test his limits — and his very humanity.\n\nAt the edge of despair, destiny awaits."
  },
